```mermaid
flowchart TB
    U[Account Holder / Operator]

    subgraph Client["Client Layer"]
        WEB[React + TypeScript + Vite]
    end

    subgraph Edge["Edge & Gateway"]
        GW[API Gateway]
    end

    subgraph Services["Domain Microservices"]
        AUTH[Auth Service]
        ACCT[Account Service]
        TRANS[Transfer Service]
        TX[Transaction Service]
    end

    subgraph Messaging["Event Backbone"]
        KAFKA[Apache Kafka]
    end

    subgraph Persistence["Private Data Stores (Per-Service)"]
        CASS_AUTH[(Cassandra - Auth)]
        CASS_ACCT[(Cassandra - Account)]
        CASS_TRANS[(Cassandra - Transfer)]
        CASS_TX[(Cassandra - Transaction)]
    end

    U --> WEB
    WEB --> GW
    GW --> AUTH
    GW --> ACCT
    GW --> TRANS
    GW --> TX

    AUTH --> CASS_AUTH
    ACCT --> CASS_ACCT
    TRANS --> CASS_TRANS
    TX --> CASS_TX

    AUTH -. domain events .-> KAFKA
    ACCT -. account events .-> KAFKA
    TRANS -. transfer saga events .-> KAFKA
    TX -. consumes events .-> KAFKA
    KAFKA -.-> ACCT
    KAFKA -.-> TRANS
    KAFKA -.-> TX
```
